Description: Lightweight push-to-hold voice input for Linux
 Headless user-session service. Hold right Ctrl to record, release to
 paste Doubao ASR text into the active application. The optional login
 helper requires GTK4 and WebKit. The optional status badge uses GTK3
 and Cairo on X11, or desktop notifications on Wayland.
 .
 Python dependencies are managed by the user with uv. Installation does
 not download Python packages or start the microphone service as root.
